 "lab": {
  "title": "Port security",
  "text": "К порту Fa0/1 разрешено подключать только рабочий компьютер PC1.\n\n1. Переведите Fa0/1 в режим access и включите на нём port security.\n2. Разрешите один MAC-адрес и запомните его автоматически (`mac-address sticky`), нарушение — shutdown.\n3. Проверьте `show port-security interface fa0/1` и связь PC1 со шлюзом.",
  "checks": [
   "psec SW1 Fa0/1 | Port security включён на Fa0/1",
   "ping PC1 192.168.1.1 | PC1 работает через защищённый порт"
  ],
  "translations": {
   "en": {
    "title": "Port security",
    "text": "Only the office PC1 may be connected to port Fa0/1.\n\n1. Make Fa0/1 an access port and enable port security on it.\n2. Allow one MAC address, learn it automatically (`mac-address sticky`), violation mode shutdown.\n3. Check `show port-security interface fa0/1` and that PC1 reaches its gateway.",
    "checks": [
     "Port security is on for Fa0/1",
     "PC1 works through the secured port"
    ]
   }
  },
  "script": {
   "SW1": "enable\nconfigure terminal\ninterface fa0/1\nswitchport mode access\nswitchport port-security\nswitchport port-security maximum 1\nswitchport port-security mac-address sticky\nswitchport port-security violation shutdown\nend"
  }
 }
}